<title>UK: Cricket-Australia v England first test scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australia v England first test scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of the first test between England and Australia at Edgbaston on Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 118 (A.Caddick 5-50)</p>
<p>England first innings 478-9 declared (N.Hussain 207, G.Thorpe 138, M.Ealham 53)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 256-1)</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Croft		    66</p>
<p> M.Taylor c and b Croft	    129</p>
<p> G.Blewett c Butcher b Croft     125</p>
<p> S.Waugh lbw b Gough		  33</p>
<p> M.Bevan c Hussain b Gough	  24</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Stewart b Gough	   1</p>
<p> I.Healy c Atherton b Ealham	30</p>
<p> S.Warne c and b Ealham	     32</p>
<p> M.Kasprowicz c Butcher b Ealham   0</p>
<p> J.Gillespie run out		   0</p>
<p> G.McGrath not out		     0</p>
<p> Extras (b-18 lb-12 w-2 nb-5)     37</p>
<p> Total				   477</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-133 2-327 3-354 4-393 5-399 6-431 7-465 8-465 9-477.</p>
<p>Bowling: Gough 35-7-123-3, Malcolm 21-6-52-0, Croft 43-10-125-3, Caddick 30-6-87-0, Ealham 15.4-3-60-3</p>
<p>England second innings</p>
<p> M.Butcher lbw b Kasprowicz	 14</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out		   57</p>
<p> A.Stewart not out		    40</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-4)		     8</p>
<p> Total (for one wicket)	    119</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-29</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 7-1-42-0, Kasprowicz 7-0-42-1,  Warne 7.3-0-27-0</p>
<p>Result: England won by 9 wickets</p>
<p>Second test: Lord's, June 19 to 23</p>
</text>
